[CR CR2450r1 for 38.133] Reason for change: According current RAN4 agreement in Section 9.2.1, UE can perform intra-frequency SSB based measurement corresponding to a deactivated SCell or dormant SCell with NCSG. However, RAN4 only updated the corresponding interruption requirements for deactivated SCell. The dormant SCell part is missing In section 9.1.9 According to RAN2 agreement, NCSG is only applicable to NR SA. According to RAN2 decision, Rel-15 mgta is re-used with a new mgta-r17 added with 0.75ms Wrong citation to the NCSG gap interruption tables In the WF R4-2210588, RAN4 agreed to remove the interruption requirements for 0.5ms mgta for FR1 NCSG and 0.25ms mgta for FR2 NCSG. However it is still not refelcted in the current spec. Some editorial errors are in the spec RAN2 has introduced the UE capability for supported NCSG patterns for NR-only measurements. Need an update to NOTE 4 in Table 9.1.9.3-2 RAN2 has introduced 2 separated UE capabilities for NR and EUTRAN reporting: nr-NeedForGapNCSG-reporting, eutra-NeedForGapNCSG-reporting. The corresponding IE needs to be updated in Sections 9.2.1, 9.3.1 and 9.4.1. In section 9.3.10.3.2, the UE capability [simultaneousRxDataSSB-DiffNumerology] is not applicable for the case when the inter-frequency layer is not on the same band with UE’s serving cell(s). In section 9.5.4.1, the term xGP is wrong Summary of change: Add a note in the interruption requirement of RRM measurement to dormant SCell that the current requirement is not appicable when UE is configured with NCSG. In section 9.1.9 Remove EN-DC, NE-DC and NR-DC from the applicable operation mode Change [NCSGTA] to mgta, which represent both mgta and mgta-r17 Correct the citation to NCSG gap interruption tables Remove the interruption requirements for 0.5ms mgta for FR1 NCSG and 0.25ms mgta for FR2 NCSG Correct editorial errors Change the UE capability in NOTE 4 of Table 9.1.9.3-2 to ncsg-MeasGapNR-Patterns-r17 Update to the correct IE in Sections 9.2.1, 9.3.1 and 9.4.1. In section 9.3.10.3.2, add a limitation that the UE capability [simultaneousRxDataSSB-DiffNumerology] is only applicable for the case when the inter-frequency layer is on the same band with UE’s serving cell(s). In section 9.5.4.1, change xGP to xRP Consequences if not approved: The spec itself is not consistent The citations to the tables are wrong

